<title>UK: POLL - CSFB tops East Europe research - Extel.</title>
<headline>POLL - CSFB tops East Europe research - Extel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston is the top Central and East Europe research team according to the 1997 Extel survey of investment analysts, weighted by size of funds managed by the firms which voted for them.</p>
<p>Rankings</p>
<p>1. Credit Suisse First Boston</p>
<p>2. Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>3. NatWest Securities</p>
<p>4. SBC Warburg</p>
<p>5. Creditanstalt</p>
<p>6. Dresdner Kleinwort Benson</p>
<p>7. ING Barings.</p>
<p>-- James Saft, London newsroom +44 171 542 2734</p>
</text>
